; Multi-currency investment example for testing per-commodity formatting
; Demonstrates EUR (€), USD ($), and GBP (£) with different decimal styles

commodity €1.000,00
  format 1.000,00 €

commodity 1,000.00 USD
  format 1,000.00 USD

commodity 1,000.00 GBP
  format 1,000.00 GBP

commodity XEON
  format 1.000,0000 XEON

commodity VWCE
  format 1.000,0000 VWCE

commodity VUSA
  format 1.000,0000 VUSA

P 2026-01-01 XEON €155,50
P 2026-01-01 VWCE €120,75
P 2026-01-01 VUSA $98,50

2026-01-15 Buy XEON (EUR denominated ETF)
    assets:investments:xeon      10 XEON @ €155,50
    assets:bank:fineco               €-1.555,00

2026-01-15 Buy VWCE (EUR denominated ETF)
    assets:investments:vwce      5 VWCE @ €120,75
    assets:bank:fineco               €-603,75

2026-02-01 Buy VUSA (USD denominated ETF)
    assets:investments:vusa     15 VUSA @ $98,50
    assets:bank:fineco               $-1.477,50

2026-02-15 Buy more XEON
    assets:investments:xeon       3 XEON @ €158,20
    assets:bank:fineco               €-474,60
